# Negative-Dataset Sweep: Class-Imbalanced Mode (All Positives, Variable Negatives)
#
# Overall Goal
# - Train D-MPNN models across negative-set sizes, negative-selection strategies,
#   and random seeds while keeping all PK + 37K positives, to test how negative
#   composition affects hit prediction in the original (class-imbalanced) regime.
#
# Relation to Manuscript
# - Generates the class-imbalanced arm of the negative-dataset sensitivity sweep
#   visualized in Figure S2 (paired with the class-balanced sweep in
#   S2_experiment_to_test_diff_neg_datasets_train_models_class_balanced.sh).
#
# Sweep
# - Negative-selection strategies: random, similar (Tanimoto-to-positives), diverse (MaxMin).
# - Negative-set sizes (N): 508, 1017, 2034, 4068, 8136, 16272, 29950
#   (pos/2, pos, 2*pos, 4*pos, 8*pos, 16*pos, all-available negatives;
#   `random` strategy only at the largest size since similar/diverse subsets equal it).
# - Seeds: 0, 1, 2 (3 replicates per (strategy, size) combination).
#
# Run Configuration
# - Architecture: dropout 0.1, hidden_size 500, ffn_num_layers 2, depth 3.
# - Features: rdkit_2d_normalized (no scaling).
# - Split: scaffold_balanced 80 / 10 / 10; num_folds 5; ensemble_size 2.
# - Primary metric: prc-auc; extra: auc; GPU 0.
#
# Inputs / Outputs
# - Input CSVs: ../out/experiment_to_test_different_negative_datasets_seeded/{strategy}_seed_{i}_N_{neg}.csv
# - Trained models: models/experiment_with_diff_neg_datasets_seeded/{strategy}_seed_{i}_N_{neg}/
#
# Provenance
# - Auto-generated by S2_try_different_negative_datasets_combined.ipynb (class_imbalanced mode).

